  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Protobuf: Allow all protobuf fields to have a plugin dissector",
  "description": "As of now a plugin sub-dissector can register itself for byte or string type only.\nThis change removes that restriction and allows to adds a plugin to register a sub-dissector for any protobuf field.\nthis sub-dissector will be able to dissect a protobuf field on top of the existing dissector for that field.\n\nPlease refer the attached screenshot that shows the newly added option in ui.\n![pbufupdated](/uploads/270fe2c9eb62ddd1396ec4e4cd12c74f/pbufupdated.png)",
  "state": "merged",
