    },
    {
      "id": "f5df1eac3016588b157dde665fc45e7fde5b2cd9",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 536443587,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hi,\nI was just thinking that if there is no plugin dissector ther will not be a problem and if you do have one you probably want to invoke it. So it's more of a question if it exists or not? This was just to simply fy the code.\nBut I have no strong opinion just let me know if you want this as it is.",
